{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103492","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103492","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710349201:1":{"text":"마법 사무국의 오래된 기록에서 본 적 있어요. 이건 빨간색과 파란색 장벽이네요.","source_cn":"殿下，我在魔法事务司的旧档案里见过这个。这是红蓝屏障。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x856D2446AF0F1BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710349202:1":{"text":"마법사들이 자주 사용하는 방어 마법이에요. 중요한 물자나 문서를 보관한 구역을 봉쇄할 때 쓰죠.","source_cn":"这是魔法师常用的一种通用防御魔法，通常用来封锁存放重要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB243871C76CD5215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710349203:0":{"text":"그런데 이게 왜 고대의 전당에 있는 걸까요?","source_cn":"那为什么会突然出现在圣古堂里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F81902CCDD96BCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710349204:1":{"text":"아마 방금 출구를 차단한 이상 마력 파동 탓에, 휴면 상태였던 장벽들이 우연히 활성화된 것 같아요.","source_cn":"恐怕是因为刚才那个切断出口的异常魔力波动，使得这些原本...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3442B71BB7818B13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710349205:1":{"text":"운이 없기도 하지... 그럼 이건 어떻게 푸나요? 기록을 읽어봤다면 방법을 알고 있겠죠?","source_cn":"真是倒霉……那这个要怎么解开？既然你读过档案，应该知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13EFAC18F99487D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710349206:1":{"text":"네. 이건 같은 색상 공명 법칙을 따르고 있거든요.","source_cn":"是的，这种封印的原理基于同色共鸣法则。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x434DD6DE28DA3F92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710349207:1":{"text":"왼쪽 문 옆에 같은 색의 수정석 장치가 있어요. 마력을 주입해 파란색 수정석 장치를 활성화하면, 파란색 장벽을 중화시킬 수 있어요. 빨간색 장벽도 마찬가지예요.","source_cn":"左侧的门旁有同色晶石机关，只要注入魔力激活蓝色晶石机关...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EA7729D340D1444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710349208:0":{"text":"그럼 안쪽으로 들어가려면, 먼저 길을 막고 있는 파란색 장벽부터 해결해야겠네요.","source_cn":"那既然我们要往深处走，就得先把挡路的这个蓝色屏障解决掉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFCA0DE1392BD40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710349209:1":{"text":"마력을 주입하면 되는 건가요? 제가 해볼게요!","source_cn":"注入魔力吗？我去试试看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED34F17AF2195A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"카세디아","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"페기","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}